# Purple team — version control hygiene
#
# ACTION CONTEXT: this directory was entirely UNTRACKED as of 2026-08-14. Before it
# enters version control, the following must never be committed.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SECRETS — fixture private keys are TEST_ONLY but must never enter git history.
# Guarded by 00-shared/tools/test_repo_hygiene.py (falsification test).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/_fixture_private_keys.json
# Fixture trust material is GENERATED, never committed: committed public records
# with gitignored private keys left a fresh clone unable to run the rehearsal.
# Regenerate: python exercise/tests/fixtures/make_fixture_trust.py
exercise/tests/fixtures/trust/
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/authority.pem
**/*_private*.json

# Live opening material: secret until reveal. Committing it destroys commitment hiding.
exercise/white/_test_attestation.json
**/opening_material/
**/*.opening.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# RUNTIME / EVIDENCE — regenerated, and nonce ledgers are machine-local state
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
exercise/evidence/clearance.json
exercise/evidence/used_nonces.json
# Lock files are machine-local runtime state, never shared artifacts.
*.lock
exercise/evidence/_test_*.json
**/runtime/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# BUILD ARTIFACTS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ruff_cache/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.coverage

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Temporary files created by tests
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/_tmp_*.json
**/*.tmp
